{"strings": {"Assets/Content/Notes/House1/Letter to Fredrik.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "AliceNote1": {"NoteInfo:id": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "Letter to Fredrik": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "Fredrik,\n\nI can't talk about this face to face so I decided to write a letter for you. I really want to share some concerns that have been weighing heavily on my mind lately.\n\nAs you know, Pia has always been close to me, but she has become very dependent on me and I’m beginning to feel overwhelmed by the constant need to be her anchor. My own mental health is suffering, and I'm worried I won't be able to keep taking care of her.\n\nCan we find others to help Pia? I am grateful for your medicine, which has kept Pia in good health and I appreciate any help you can offer.\n\n- Alice": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "Ambience": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "Rain": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "Wood sounds": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "Music": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "Lamp": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}, "Fridge": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets20.assets"]}}}